  "cgu_title": "Terms and Conditions (T&C)",
  "cgu_section1_title": "1. About the Application",
  "cgu_section1_text": "The MIPS app is a platform for posting and viewing ads using the FAKA Token. These Terms and Conditions (T&C) define the rules for using the app, for both registered and non-registered users.",
  "cgu_section2_title": "2. Acceptance of the T&C",
  "cgu_section2_text": "By accessing the MAHAFAKA app, the user acknowledges having read these T&C and agrees to comply with them.",
  "cgu_section3_title": "3. Registration and User Account",
  "cgu_section3_text": "To access certain features, the user must create an account by providing the following information:\n- Username\n- Gender\n- Year of birth\n- Place of residence\n- Password\n- Email\n- Phone number\n\nThe user agrees to provide accurate and up-to-date information. If inaccurate information is provided, MAHAFAKA reserves the right to suspend or delete the account.",
  "cgu_section4_title": "4. Use Without Login (No Authentication)",
  "cgu_section4_text": "Non-registered users can access certain features of the app, such as viewing ads. However, posting and some interactions require a user account.",
  "cgu_section5_title": "5. FAKA Token",
  "cgu_section5_text": "The FAKA Token is used for posting ads. The terms for obtaining and using the FAKA Token are defined in MAHAFAKA’s specific conditions.",
  "cgu_section6_title": "6. Personal Data Protection",
  "cgu_section6_text": "Information provided during registration is processed in accordance with our privacy policy. No personal data will be sold or shared with third parties without the user’s consent.",
  "cgu_section7_title": "7. User Responsibilities",
  "cgu_section7_text": "The user agrees to:\n- Not post ads containing false, illegal, or offensive information.\n- Comply with applicable laws and third-party rights.\n- Not use the app for fraudulent or malicious purposes.",
  "cgu_section8_title": "8. Changes to the T&C",
  "cgu_section8_text": "MAHAFAKA reserves the right to modify these T&C at any time. Users will be notified of changes via the app.",
  "cgu_section9_title": "9. Contact",
  "cgu_section9_text": "For any questions about the T&C, users can contact the MAHAFAKA team via the app or by email.",
